<section class="app-page active" data-page-panel="dashboard">
  <div class="hero-panel"><div><span class="status-pill"><i class="bi bi-circle-fill"></i><span id="hero-status">缓存模式</span></span><h2 id="server-name">选择一台 Palworld 服务器</h2><p id="server-description">在线时自动刷新，离线时继续浏览本地缓存。</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="sync"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat me-2"></i>立即同步</button><button class="btn btn-surface" data-action="broadcast"><i class="bi bi-megaphone me-2"></i>游戏内广播</button></div></div>
  <div class="metric-grid metric-grid-6">
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon violet"><i class="bi bi-people"></i></span><div><small>在线玩家</small><strong id="metric-players">— / —</strong><span>当前 / 最大</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon blue"><i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i></span><div><small>游戏版本</small><strong id="metric-version">—</strong><span>服务端版本</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon green"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i></span><div><small>运行时间</small><strong id="metric-uptime">—</strong><span>服务器进程</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon amber"><i class="bi bi-sun"></i></span><div><small>服务器天数</small><strong id="metric-day">—</strong><span>世界日</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon blue"><i class="bi bi-speedometer"></i></span><div><small>服务器 FPS</small><strong id="metric-fps">—</strong><span>实时帧率</span></div></article>
    <article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon violet"><i class="bi bi-stopwatch"></i></span><div><small>帧时间</small><strong id="metric-frame-time">—</strong><span>毫秒</span></div></article>
  </div>
  <div class="content-grid"><article class="surface span-2"><div class="surface-header"><div><h3>数据状态</h3><p>远程连接与本地缓存状态</p></div><span id="cache-badge" class="soft-badge">暂无缓存</span></div><div class="empty-state compact" id="health-content"><i class="bi bi-database"></i><strong>选择服务器以读取数据</strong></div></article><article class="surface"><div class="surface-header"><div><h3>快捷操作</h3><p>常用 RCON 命令</p></div></div><div class="quick-actions"><button data-command="Save"><i class="bi bi-cloud-check"></i><span><strong>保存世界</strong><small>立即持久化存档</small></span></button><button data-action="broadcast"><i class="bi bi-megaphone"></i><span><strong>游戏内广播</strong><small>向所有在线玩家发送</small></span></button><button data-navigate="players"><i class="bi bi-person-lines-fill"></i><span><strong>玩家档案</strong><small>筛选及查看缓存</small></span></button></div></article></div>
</section>

<section class="app-page" data-page-panel="servers"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>服务器</h2><p>管理 REST、RCON 连接和本地 JSON 缓存。</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="new-connection"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-2"></i>添加服务器</button></div><div id="server-list" class="server-list"></div></section>

<section class="app-page" data-page-panel="players">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h2>玩家档案</h2><p>在线与历史玩家数据；点击玩家查看帕鲁、物品及详细信息。</p></div><button class="btn btn-surface" data-action="sync"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-2"></i>同步</button></div>
  <div class="data-toolbar"><div class="search-box"><i class="bi bi-search"></i><input id="player-filter" placeholder="筛选名称、UID、Steam64、公会或 IP"></div><select id="player-status-filter" class="form-select"><option value="all">全部状态</option><option value="online">仅在线</option><option value="offline">仅离线</option></select><select id="player-sort" class="form-select"><option value="online">在线优先</option><option value="name">按玩家名称</option><option value="level-desc">等级从高到低</option><option value="ping">Ping 从低到高</option><option value="lastOnline">最后在线</option></select></div>
  <div id="players-grid" class="player-grid"></div>
</section>

<section class="app-page" data-page-panel="guilds">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h2>公会</h2><p>浏览公会等级与成员；玩家和公会支持双向跳转。</p></div><button class="btn btn-surface" data-action="sync"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-2"></i>同步</button></div>
  <div class="data-toolbar"><div class="search-box"><i class="bi bi-search"></i><input id="guild-filter" placeholder="筛选公会名称或成员"></div><select id="guild-sort" class="form-select"><option value="name">按名称</option><option value="level-desc">等级从高到低</option><option value="members-desc">成员数从多到少</option></select></div>
  <div id="guild-list" class="guild-grid"></div>
</section>

<section class="app-page" data-page-panel="console"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>RCON 控制台</h2><p>向当前服务器发送远程管理命令。</p></div><div class="d-flex gap-2"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="broadcast"><i class="bi bi-megaphone me-2"></i>发送广播</button><button class="btn btn-surface" data-action="clear-console"><i class="bi bi-trash3 me-2"></i>清空</button></div></div><article class="console-panel"><div class="console-toolbar"><span><i class="bi bi-circle-fill text-success"></i> RCON SESSION</span><small>命令仅发送至当前服务器</small></div><div id="console-output" class="console-output"><p class="console-muted">Palworld Server Studio · RCON console ready.</p></div><form id="console-form" class="console-input"><span>›</span><input id="console-command" autocomplete="off" placeholder="输入 RCON 命令…"><button type="submit">执行 <kbd>Enter</kbd></button></form></article><div class="command-chips"><span>常用命令</span><button data-fill-command="Info">Info</button><button data-fill-command="ShowPlayers">ShowPlayers</button><button data-fill-command="Save">Save</button><button data-action="broadcast">Broadcast</button></div></section>

<section class="app-page" data-page-panel="backups"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>备份</h2><p>备份模块预留给服务器端代理或 SFTP 数据源。</p></div></div><article class="surface"><div class="empty-state tall"><span class="empty-illustration"><i class="bi bi-archive"></i></span><strong>还没有备份记录</strong><span>REST 与 RCON 不提供存档文件下载能力。</span></div></article></section>

<section class="app-page" data-page-panel="settings"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>设置</h2><p>缓存策略与应用信息。</p></div></div><div class="settings-grid"><article class="surface"><div class="surface-header"><div><h3>自动同步</h3><p>在线时每 30 秒刷新本地 JSON 快照</p></div><i class="bi bi-database-check setting-icon"></i></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>离线缓存</strong><small>服务器不可用时保留最后一次成功数据</small></div><span class="soft-badge success">已启用</span></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>每日等级统计</strong><small>每天本地时间 0 点刷新等级基线</small></div><span class="soft-badge">00:00</span></div></article><article class="surface"><div class="surface-header"><div><h3>关于</h3><p>桌面应用信息</p></div><i class="bi bi-info-circle setting-icon"></i></div><div class="about-logo"><span class="brand-mark"><i class="bi bi-hexagon-fill"></i></span><div><strong>Palworld Server Studio</strong><small id="app-version">正在读取版本…</small></div></div></article></div></section>
